&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TL;DR:&lt;/strong&gt; GridKit Enhanced adds enterprise features (audit logs, analytics, validation, plugins) to TanStack Table in 2-3 days instead of 3-4 weeks of custom development. Overhead: ~5-15ms. &lt;a href="https://codesandbox.io/p/sandbox/gridkit-exchanged-chykt4" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Try the live demo →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
